    intro: "Test everything; hold fast what is good. The Bereans received the word with all eagerness, examining the Scriptures daily to see if these things were so. The one who states his case first seems right, until the other comes and examines him. In a world of constant information, some true and some false, children need to learn to ask questions, to check and to love the truth.",
